 .../door_open_homie_29dof_state_ppo_plr.yaml  | 279 ++++++++++++++++++
 gr00t/rl/envs/door/door_mirror.py             |   3 +-
 gr00t/rl/envs/door/door_open_homie.py         |  68 +++++
